This is my first date.

335
00:32:11.547 --> 00:32:14.281
This is not a date.

336
00:32:14.283 --> 00:32:15.550
Well, sure it is.

337
00:32:15.552 --> 00:32:16.585
No.

338
00:32:16.587 --> 00:32:19.621
