want to know.

495
00:49:57.780 --> 00:50:00.313
I wanna know everything.

496
00:50:00.315 --> 00:50:01.784
Do you?

497
00:50:18.334 --> 00:50:21.668
KERRY: Is that man
with the beard your dad?

498
00:50:21.670 --> 00:50:23.704
