669
01:07:45.345 --> 01:07:46.879
No.

670
01:07:46.881 --> 01:07:50.816
We prefer to live separate
from mainstream society.

671
01:07:50.818 --> 01:07:52.920
It deadens the soul.

672
01:07:55.489 --> 01:07:58.691
